{"groups":[{"members":["c1","c2"],"primary":"c1","title":"Massachusetts cap on upfront payments at or before tenancy commencement (M.G.L. c. 186, § 15B(1)(b))","requirement":"At or before the start of a tenancy, a lessor or the lessor's agent may not require a tenant or prospective tenant to pay anything beyond first month's rent, last month's rent, a security deposit of no more than one month's rent, and the cost of buying and installing a key and lock. Landlord-imposed application or screening fees are therefore not permitted.","key_value":"Upfront charges limited to first month's rent + last month's rent + security deposit (max 1 month's rent) + key and lock cost; no landlord application fee","status":"in_force","effective_date":null,"end_date":null,"citation":"M.G.L. c. 186, § 15B","coverage_conditions":"Residential rental tenancies in Massachusetts; applies to lessors and, under the text effective Aug 1, 2025, agents of the lessor.","exemptions":"Does not apply to any lease, rental, occupancy or tenancy of 100 days or less that is for a vacation or recreational purpose.","coverage_from":"c1","conflict_note":null},{"members":["c3"],"primary":"c3","title":"Massachusetts broker fee rule: only the party who engaged the broker pays the fee (M.G.L. c. 112, § 87DDD 1/2, as amended by St. 2025, c. 9, § 43)","requirement":"Anyone who finds rental housing for prospective tenants for a fee must be a licensed broker or salesperson. Any broker fee may be paid only by the party, lessor or tenant, who originally engaged and contracted with the broker, so a tenant cannot be charged the fee of a broker engaged by the landlord.","key_value":"Broker fee payable only by the party who engaged the broker","status":"in_force","effective_date":"2025-08-01","end_date":null,"citation":"M.G.L. c. 112, § 87DDD 1/2; St. 2025, c. 9, § 43","coverage_conditions":"Licensed brokers and salespersons finding residential rental dwelling accommodations for a fee in Massachusetts.","exemptions":null,"coverage_from":"c3","conflict_note":null}],"dropped":[]}
